{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在TVB節目《今個夏天食平D》中，肥媽推介了一款適合夏天飲用的湯水——鮮霸王花煲瘦肉。這款湯水具備清熱潤肺功效，而且味道清甜，喝完之後感覺非常舒服。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1c6ca998-899d-47c7-bdff-9e9411195cac.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20262M2NiSflPi1786009903.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1c6ca998-899d-47c7-bdff-9e9411195cac.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong> 鮮霸王花煲瘦肉｜準備食材</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">新鮮霸王花</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">瘦肉</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">紅蘿蔔</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蜜棗</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">南北杏</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">果皮</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>鮮霸王花煲瘦肉｜做法</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">將瘦肉汆水切塊，紅蘿蔔切塊。</p></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3ff9b7d1-8726-4216-9c50-6b7ae5d49fa0.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026paXrAkfd7K1786009903.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3ff9b7d1-8726-4216-9c50-6b7ae5d49fa0.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-16T10:18:31.002318+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}